		                             <section aria-labelledby="reconnect-heading" class="cbc-reconnect-callout">
<div class="cbc-reconnect-container">
<h2 id="reconnect-heading">Introducing Cougar ReConnect</h2>
<p class="cbc-reconnect-tagline">A New Opportunity to Finish What You Started.</p>
<p class="cbc-reconnect-text">If a past-due balance has kept you from returning to Coastal Bend College, Cougar ReConnect may provide eligible former students with a pathway back. Explore your options and continue working toward completing your degree or credential.</p>
<a aria-label="Learn more about Cougar ReConnect" class="cbc-reconnect-button" href="cougar-reconnect.html"> Learn More </a></div>
</section>
<style><!--
.cbc-reconnect-callout{
    width:100%;
    background:#f3f6f8;
    padding:5rem 2rem;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

.cbc-reconnect-container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:0 auto;
    text-align:center;
}

.cbc-reconnect-container h2{
    margin:0;
    color:#004d71;
    font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);
    line-height:1.15;
    font-weight:800;
}

.cbc-reconnect-tagline{
    margin:1rem auto 2rem;
    font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,1.8rem);
    color:#4b5563;
    font-style:italic;
    line-height:1.5;
}

.cbc-reconnect-text{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:0 auto 2.5rem;
    font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.6vw,1.45rem);
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#1f2937;
}

.cbc-reconnect-button{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:1rem 2.5rem;
    background:#004d71;
    color:#ffffff;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:1.15rem;
    font-weight:700;
    border-radius:8px;
    transition:all .2s ease;
}

.cbc-reconnect-button:hover,
.cbc-reconnect-button:focus{
    background:#00618f;
    color:#ffffff;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.cbc-reconnect-button:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid #00a7e1;
    outline-offset:4px;
}

@media (max-width:992px){

    .cbc-reconnect-callout{
        padding:4rem 2rem;
    }

}

@media (max-width:768px){

    .cbc-reconnect-callout{
        padding:3rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .cbc-reconnect-text{
        line-height:1.7;
    }

    .cbc-reconnect-button{
        display:block;
        width:100%;
        max-width:360px;
        margin:0 auto;
    }

}
--></style>
