		                             <style><!--
.foundation-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e1e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 77, 113, 0.08);
    margin: 30px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.foundation-card-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 30px;
}

.foundation-logo {
    flex: 0 0 240px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 30px 10px 10px;
    border-right: 1px solid #dce5e9;
}

.foundation-logo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 210px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.foundation-content {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 5px 20px 5px 35px;
}

.foundation-content h2 {
    color: #004d71;
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
}

.foundation-accent {
    width: 55px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #00a7e1;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.foundation-content p {
    color: #37474f;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
}

.foundation-content p:last-of-type {
    color: #5b6770;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.foundation-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #004d71;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 4px;
}

.foundation-button:hover,
.foundation-button:focus {
    background: #003a56;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
}

/* Mobile */
@media screen and (max-width: 700px) {

    .foundation-card {
        margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .foundation-card-inner {
        display: block;
        padding: 22px;
    }

    .foundation-logo {
        padding: 0 0 22px 0;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #dce5e9;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .foundation-logo img {
        max-width: 180px;
    }

    .foundation-content {
        padding: 0;
    }

    .foundation-content h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
    }

    .foundation-content p {
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .foundation-button {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px 18px;
}

.foundation-buttons {
    display: block;
}
}
--></style>
<div class="foundation-card">
<div class="foundation-card-inner">
<div class="foundation-logo"><img alt="Coastal Bend College Foundation logo" height="300" src="_images/foundation_image_logo.jpg" width="300"/></div>
<div class="foundation-content">
<h2>Coastal Bend College Foundation</h2>
<div class="foundation-accent"></div>
<p>The Coastal Bend College Foundation is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit supporting CBC students and the College through scholarships, private giving, and investments in student success.</p>
<p>Explore scholarships, student support, giving opportunities, alumni and friends, and ways to make an impact.</p>
<div class="foundation-buttons"><a class="foundation-button" href="https://www.thecbcfoundation.org/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Visit the CBC Foundation &#8250;</a> <a class="foundation-button" href="foundation/fall-2026-coastal-bend-college-foundation-scholarship-application-form-1.pdf" rel="noopener" target="_blank">2026-2027 Scholarship Application &#8250;</a></div>
<p class="foundation-note"><span><br/>Please email your scholarship application to <a href="mailto:foundation@coastalbend.edu">foundation@coastalbend.edu</a>&#160;or drop it off at the Foundation Office at Hall Bldg. #139-A.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
